{
  "id": 5726075388057,
  "title": "First Ascent Men's Stretch Fit Hiking Pants",
  "handle": "first-ascent-mens-stretch-fit-hiking-pants",
  "description": "<h3><span>Description</span></h3>\n<div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-12 product-info\">\n<div class=\"short-description\">\n<p class=\"std\">The Men's Stretch Fit Hiking Pants are made to scramble and climb up mountains without limiting your movement. Engineered to be durable and comfortable, these hiking pants will keep you adventuring for longer. Designed with mechanical Stretch Fit fabric to stretch in any direction, these pants will have you moving freely, no matter the size of the mountain.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3><span>Features</span></h3>\n<ul></ul>\n<div class=\"content-wrapper\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div class=\"std\" itemprop=\"description\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Stretch Fit fabric for complete freedom of movement during physical activity</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Articulated knees for improved comfort on the go</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">UPF 30 sun protection</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Four reinforced pockets for added storage of essentials</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Adjustable elasticated waistband for an improved fit</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Inner leg gusset for added range of movement for your legs</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul></ul>\n<h3>Specifications<br>\n</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Materials: 90% Polyester 10% Spandex<br>\n</li>\n</ul>",
